#: src/pages/settings/applications/utils/getStandardApplicationDescription.ts
#. js-lingui-id: HP7per
msgid ""
"The base data model every Twenty workspace runs on.\n"
"\n"
"#### What \"foundation\" means\n"
"\n"
"Every Twenty workspace starts with this set of objects. They define the shape of your CRM, including relationships, activity, and reporting. Everything else, including marketplace apps, AI agents, and custom objects, plugs into them.\n"
"\n"
"#### Included objects\n"
"- **People & Companies**: contact and account records\n"
"- **Opportunities**: your sales pipeline\n"
"- **Notes & Tasks**: activity and follow-ups\n"
"- **Workflows & Dashboards**: automation and reporting\n"
"\n"
"Remove this app and the rest of Twenty has nothing to hang off.\n"
"\n"
"#### Build your own app\n"
"\n"
"Extend Twenty with your own objects, fields, logic functions, or AI skills. Scaffold a new app in one command:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"npx create-twenty-app@latest my-twenty-app\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Then inside the folder:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"cd my-twenty-app\n"
"yarn twenty dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"See the [Getting Started guide](https://twenty.com/developers/extend/apps/getting-started) for the full walkthrough, and [Building Apps](https://twenty.com/developers/extend/apps/building) for the `defineApplication` / `defineEntity` APIs."
msgstr ""
"Den grundlæggende datamodel, som hvert CloseAI-arbejdsområde kører på.\n"
"\n"
"#### Hvad \"fundament\" betyder\n"
"\n"
"Hvert CloseAI-arbejdsområde starter med dette sæt objekter. De definerer formen på dit CRM, inklusive relationer, aktivitet og rapportering. Alt andet, inklusive marketplace-apps, AI-agenter og brugerdefinerede objekter, tilsluttes dem.\n"
"\n"
"#### Medfølgende objekter\n"
"- **Personer og virksomheder**: kontakt- og virksomhedsoptegnelser\n"
"- **Salgsmuligheder**: din salgspipeline\n"
"- **Noter og opgaver**: aktivitet og opfølgninger\n"
"- **Arbejdsgange og dashboards**: automatisering og rapportering\n"
"\n"
"Fjerner du denne app, har resten af CloseAI ikke noget at hænge på.\n"
"\n"
"#### Byg din egen app\n"
"\n"
"Udvid CloseAI med dine egne objekter, felter, logiske funktioner eller AI-færdigheder. Opret en ny app med én kommando:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"npx create-twenty-app@latest my-twenty-app\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Gå derefter ind i mappen:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"cd my-twenty-app\n"
"yarn twenty dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Se [Kom godt i gang-guiden](https://app.closeai.pt) for den fulde gennemgang, og [Byg apps](https://app.closeai.pt) for `defineApplication` / `defineEntity` API'er."

